            <ArticleTitle>Management of cancer-related pain with transdermal fentanyl.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study demonstrates that TTS-fentanyl can provide sufficient pain relief in cancer patients equivalent to that achieved with morphine with additional benefits of convenience and reduced side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
